        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Study Notes</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #333;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .container {\n        max-width: 800px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .item {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .number {\n        width: 35px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .content {\n        flex-grow: 1;\n    }\n    .red-text {\n        color: #c00000;\n    }\n    .indent {\n        margin-left: 2.5em;\n    }\n    .indent-more {\n        margin-left: 5em;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">52:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】题目中有“<span class=\"red-text\">依次</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有依次，直接选。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">53:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】“<span class=\"red-text\">减速</span>”跟“<span class=\"red-text\">确认安全</span>”√ “<span class=\"red-text\">应当</span>”√，<span class=\"red-text\">应当+两年</span>×</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题:题目中有确认安全，答对。选择题:选项中一个确认安全直接选，两个确认安全选带减速或低速的。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">54:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】判断题：凡是见到判断题里有“” (双引号) 的就答√</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"red-text\">礼让</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有礼让，直接选。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"red-text\">避免</span>”，答对。不避让，答错。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"red-text\">主动</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有主动，直接选。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">55:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】关键词:<span class=\"red-text\">减速、靠右依次</span></div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题:题目中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，答对。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">选择题:选项中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，直接选。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">56:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】关键词:<span class=\"red-text\">减速、停车</span> 选择题:选项中减速、停车，直接选。</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">57:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【文明驾驶题】关键词:<span class=\"red-text\">安全距离</span></div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">选择题:选项中有一个安全距离直接选，两个安全距离选带大字的。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">关键词:<span class=\"red-text\">加速</span> 判断题:题目中有加速，答错(加速过急除外)</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">58:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【违法行为】</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">判断题：<span class=\"red-text\">违法行为</span>，答√；没有违法答×<span class=\"red-text\">违章行为</span>，答×。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">选择题:题目中问属于什么行为?直接选违法行为。</div>\n            <div class=\"indent-more\">问“几种违法行为”选“三种违法行为”</div>\n            <div class=\"indent\">关键词:<span class=\"red-text\">可可选不、可可可选非、未未未选其他。</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">59:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【新能源/电动】</div>\n            <div>题中见：电动汽车答√，同时出现无需、频繁刹车答×</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"number red-text\">60:</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div>【急救伤员题】</div>\n            <div>看到【中毒】要<span class=\"red-text\">撤离、转移</span>，原地等待不是救援，是<span class=\"red-text\">原地等死</span>，</div>\n            <div>【昏迷】首先要检查是否有<span class=\"red-text\">呼吸脉搏</span></div>\n            <div>【骨折】<span class=\"red-text\">不要移动</span>，用三角巾固定3-4人平移<span class=\"red-text\">硬担架</span></div>\n            <div>【失血】<span class=\"red-text\">先止血</span>，止血从源头止，<span class=\"red-text\">近心端动脉</span></div>\n            <div>【全身烧伤】喷<span class=\"red-text\">冷水灭火</span></div>\n            <div>【烧伤口渴】可喝<span class=\"red-text\">淡盐水</span>，只喝白开水100度答×</div>\n            <div>【烧伤起泡】用<span class=\"red-text\">保鲜膜覆盖</span>，避免感染</div>\n            <div>【包扎】<span class=\"red-text\">不能用麻绳</span>，错误选项，选麻绳</div>\n            <div>【昏迷伤】员搬运需<span class=\"red-text\">侧卧</span>，仰卧分泌物误入气管，会有<span class=\"red-text\">窒息危险</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
